00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:40.260
I had fun.

00:18:41.460 --> 00:18:43.270
Throw me away.

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:46.270
Throw me away and forget 
me so you can live.

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:47.810
I won't.

00:18:56.380 --> 00:18:57.310
Marian?

00:18:58.840 --> 00:19:00.160
Mariandel?

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:18.500
I see.

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:21.910
The name Marian is using is the name

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:24.390
of the person she loved in the past.

00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:28.640
By becoming her, she's reliving 
life for that unlucky girl.

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:32.190
So don't talk badly 
about her so much.

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:34.690
I'm sorry.

00:19:46.640 --> 00:19:49.830
Ah, man. I'm so...

00:19:51.300 --> 00:19:52.130
Damn it!

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:57.000
Thanks!

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:58.750
That was fun!

00:19:58.750 --> 00:20:00.840
Bye!

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:05.280
I'm Marian. Meow, 
meow meow, meow meow!

00:20:05.280 --> 00:20:07.510
Hiya! How are ya doin'?

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:10.190
Kon-chan, wa-water!

00:20:10.190 --> 00:20:13.270
I want some water. Not Walter.

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:18.070
Marian, you shouldn't do this.

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:20.130
What do you mean?

00:20:20.130 --> 00:20:22.910
It might be weird for a 
kid like me to say this,

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:24.100
but isn't it important that you live

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:25.430
your life in a respectable fashion?

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:27.660
I don't get it!

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:29.490
Oh no, I spilled some.

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:30.370
It's cold!

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:31.880
Here's a towel.

00:20:34.890 --> 00:20:35.920
You pervert!

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:41.340
Wai— I just said that you should

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:43.310
treat yourself with res—

00:20:43.310 --> 00:20:47.590
I mean I'm... Huh? Um...

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:55.970
No, no, no, no, 
there's someone I like already!

00:20:58.890 --> 00:20:59.980
Want to practice?

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:02.560
P-P-Practice?!

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:04.810
What? Do what? What?!

00:21:04.810 --> 00:21:06.000
What could it be?

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:09.010
W-Wait!

00:21:16.260 --> 00:21:18.670
I think I had a bad dream.

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:21.960
Stubble? Is that stubble?

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:24.270
Did I dream about stubble?

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:31.020
L-Let's calm down.

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:33.000
Yes, let's calm down!

00:21:35.630 --> 00:21:37.510
Calm down about what?

00:21:37.510 --> 00:21:40.400
You see, this is bad, really bad!

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:41.560
You want to know what?

00:21:41.560 --> 00:21:44.200
Everything is bad, character-wise,
 logically, everything!

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:49.550
And this was an affront, 
cheating on your dead lover!

00:21:49.550 --> 00:21:50.580
Lover?

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:03.550
That was bad, I apologize.

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:05.820
You were so taking it so seriously

00:22:05.820 --> 00:22:08.530
that we couldn't help it. Sorry.

00:22:08.940 --> 00:22:11.570
But you know Sainglain, 
that was marvelous.

00:22:11.570 --> 00:22:14.560
No, no, Princess, yours was 
excellent. You had me tearing up.

00:22:14.960 --> 00:22:18.520
So what? What's the reason 
Marian's trans?

00:22:18.750 --> 00:22:22.150
Because I want to be, of course. 
Stop dreaming so much.

00:22:22.590 --> 00:22:25.540
Hey, Marian!

00:22:25.540 --> 00:22:26.360
Hi!

00:22:27.040 --> 00:22:28.850
All right, then one nugget of truth.

00:22:30.190 --> 00:22:33.710
That thing about the first 
time hurting. That's a lie.

00:24:10.090 --> 00:24:24.980
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:10.780 --> 00:24:13.000
The princess is kind 
of in a bad mood.

00:24:13.000 --> 00:24:15.480
Oh well, she's probably 
just short-tempered.

00:24:15.480 --> 00:24:17.180
She's such a child.

00:24:17.180 --> 00:24:19.760
What are Sainglain and 
Marian so afraid of?

00:24:19.760 --> 00:24:22.770
What? The St. Piria family's 
hyperactivity period?

00:24:22.770 --> 00:24:23.790
The hell's that?

00:24:24.980 --> 00:24:29.900
The upper echelons grow impatient with Incognito,

00:24:24.980 --> 00:24:29.900
and secretly dispatch the assassin Georg.

00:24:29.900 --> 00:24:34.730
after that one scene. It appears to still be in tact.

00:24:29.900 --> 00:24:34.750
Oh, and there's no need to worry about Kon's DT
